  "setting_tone": "Gaslit London streets, fog-shrouded alleys, and crumbling estates. The supernatural hides in plain sight among polite society. Séances, opium dens, and secret societies blur the line between science and the occult. Death is intimate and personal — monsters wear human faces.",
